msgctxt "120_Tokita"
msgid "Hmph. Do you really think that someone like you has what it takes to train me?"
msgstr "¿De verdad piensas que alguien como tú tiene lo necesario para entrenarme?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "132_Tokita"
msgid "Hmph. I wish you could make better use of all of the amazing skills that I have."
msgstr "Espero que puedas aprovechar todas mis habilidades."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "144_Tokita"
msgid "Heh. You should feel lucky to have an apprentice like me."
msgstr "Deberías sentirte afortunado de tenerme como aprendiz."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "156_Tokita"
msgid "Heh... This dojo isn't so bad after all."
msgstr "Je. Este dojo no está nada mal."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "168_Tokita"
msgid "I usually don't trust other people, but I guess I could make an exception for you. Heheh..."
msgstr "No suelo confiar en extraños, pero creo que podría hacer una excepción."

